# Copy to .env.local (gitignored, applies to every build mode — dev, the
# regular web build, and the Capacitor build) and fill in your real values.
# Not secret — a Google OAuth "Web application" client ID is meant to be
# public/client-side — but ships as .example since it's real credentials.

# console.cloud.google.com -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> the "Web
# application" OAuth 2.0 Client ID (see the Google sign-in setup steps).
# Unset = the Google sign-in button on /login just doesn't render.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# developer.apple.com -> Certificates, Identifiers & Profiles -> Identifiers
# -> the Services ID (not the App ID) created for Sign in with Apple.
# Unset = the Apple sign-in button on /login just doesn't render.
VITE_APPLE_CLIENT_ID=
